      "question": "There is no price ---- among Kalteco's three refrigerator models.",
      "choices": [
        "differ",
        "different",
        "difference",
        "differently"
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "topic": "词性辨析",
      "keywords": "word form noun difference",
      "answer_explain": "no 后需要名词，price 在此作名词修饰语，price difference 表示价格差异，因此选 difference。differ 是动词，different 是形容词，differently 是副词，都不能充当这里的中心名词。",
